{"ticker":"WSM","updated":"2026-11-14T01:33:58Z","profile":{"longName":"Williams-Sonoma, Inc.","shortName":"Williams-Sonoma, Inc.","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Specialty Retail","country":"United States","website":"https://www.williams-sonomainc.com","fullTimeEmployees":19800,"marketCap":29918961664,"trailingPE":26.05641,"forwardPE":24.167526,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.7374616,"pegRatio":2.5,"targetMeanPrice":251.45,"targetHighPrice":300.0,"targetLowPrice":151.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":20,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.067,"earningsGrowth":0.42,"grossMargins":0.45692003,"operatingMargins":0.17848,"profitMargins":0.14729,"totalRevenue":8005155840,"beta":1.49,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":274.45,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":165.51,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.21},"summary":"Williams-Sonoma, Inc. operates as an omni-channel specialty retailer of various products for home the United States and internationally. The company provides cooking, dining, and entertaining products, such as cookware, tools, electrics, cutlery, tabletop and bar, outdoor, furniture, and a library of cookbooks. It offers home furnishings, home decor products and accessories, bedding, lighting, rugs, table essentials, kids accessories, made-to-order lighting, hardware, personalized products, custom gifts, and vintage-inspired heirloom products. It offers its products under the Williams Sonoma, Pottery Barn, Pottery Barn Kids, Pottery Barn Teen, West Elm, Williams Sonoma Home, Rejuvenation, Mark and Graham, and GreenRow brand names. The company markets its products through e-commerce websites, direct-mail catalogs, and retail stores. Williams-Sonoma, Inc. was founded in 1956 and is headquartered in San Francisco, California.","summary_zh":"Williams-Sonoma, Inc. 是一家全通路專業零售商，為美國國內和國際市場提供各種產品。該公司提供烹飪、餐飲和娛樂產品，如炊具、工具、電器、餐具、桌面和酒吧、戶外用品、家具和烹飪書庫。它提供家居用品、家居裝飾產品和配件、床上用品、照明、地毯、餐桌必需品、兒童配件、客製化照明、五金、個人化產品、客製化禮品和復古風格的傳家寶產品。該公司以 Williams Sonoma、Pottery Barn、Potte